  <entry>
    <title>Mac本地部署Hexo</title>
    <link href="/posts/dd7e20f7.html"/>
    <url>/posts/dd7e20f7.html</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>参考文档：<a href="https://juejin.cn/post/6844904131266609165">https://juejin.cn/post/6844904131266609165</a><br>Hexo官网：<a href="https://hexo.io/">https://hexo.io/</a></p><p>环境：brew、fnm、pnpm、node24、git</p><blockquote><p>[!WARNING]</p><p>brew、fnm、pnpm需要配置国内源</p></blockquote><h1 id="安装fnm"><a href="#安装fnm" class="headerlink" title="安装fnm"></a>安装fnm</h1><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">brew install fnm<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="查看shell，并设置环境变量-国内源"><a href="#查看shell，并设置环境变量-国内源" class="headerlink" title="查看shell，并设置环境变量&#x2F;国内源"></a>查看shell，并设置环境变量&#x2F;国内源</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-variable">$SHELL</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 如果为/bin/zsh（mac 默认）</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;eval &quot;$(fnm env --use-on-cd)&quot;&#x27;</span> &gt;&gt; ~/.zshrc<br><span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;export FNM_NODE_DIST_MIRROR=&quot;https://npmmirror.com/mirrors/node&quot;&#x27;</span> &gt;&gt; ~/.zshrc<br><span class="hljs-built_in">source</span> ~/.zshrc<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 如果为/bin/bash</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;eval &quot;$(fnm env --use-on-cd)&quot;&#x27;</span> &gt;&gt; ~/.bashrc<br><span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;export FNM_NODE_DIST_MIRROR=&quot;https://npmmirror.com/mirrors/node&quot;&#x27;</span> &gt;&gt; ~/.bashrc<br><span class="hljs-built_in">source</span> ~/.bashrc<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="安装node，及常用命令"><a href="#安装node，及常用命令" class="headerlink" title="安装node，及常用命令"></a>安装node，及常用命令</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">fnm install 24    <span class="hljs-comment"># 装 node24</span><br>fnm use 24        <span class="hljs-comment"># 切换</span><br>fnm default 24    <span class="hljs-comment"># 设默认</span><br>fnm <span class="hljs-built_in">ls</span>            <span class="hljs-comment"># 已安装版本</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><blockquote><p>手动安装方法</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">wget https://github.com/Schniz/fnm/releases/latest/download/fnm-linux.zip<br>unzip fnm-linux.zip<br><span class="hljs-built_in">mv</span> fnm /usr/local/bin/<br><span class="hljs-built_in">chmod</span> +x /usr/local/bin/fnm<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure></blockquote><h1 id="安装pnpm"><a href="#安装pnpm" class="headerlink" title="安装pnpm"></a>安装pnpm</h1><p>使用brew安装pnpm可能会落后于官方版本，但不会有什么影响。</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">brew install pnpm<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="设置国内镜像"><a href="#设置国内镜像" class="headerlink" title="设置国内镜像"></a>设置国内镜像</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">pnpm config <span class="hljs-built_in">set</span> registry https://registry.npmmirror.com/<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="设置环境变量"><a href="#设置环境变量" class="headerlink" title="设置环境变量"></a>设置环境变量</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">pnpm setup<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1 id="安装hexo"><a href="#安装hexo" class="headerlink" title="安装hexo"></a>安装hexo</h1><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">pnpm install -g hexo-cli<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="构建"><a href="#构建" class="headerlink" title="构建"></a>构建</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">mkdir</span> &lt;folder&gt;  <span class="hljs-comment">#创建站点根目录</span><br>hexo init &lt;folder&gt;  <span class="hljs-comment">#使用Hexo初始化站点根目录</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">cd</span> &lt;folder&gt;  <span class="hljs-comment">#进入到站点根目录</span><br>pnpm install  <span class="hljs-comment">#安装npm所依赖的文件</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><blockquote><p>[!IMPORTANT]</p><p>若install时报错<code>Run &quot;pnpm approve-builds&quot; to pick which dependencies should be allowed to run scripts.</code><br>是因为pnpm 默认<strong>拦截危险构建脚本</strong>，Hexo 依赖需要执行构建脚本才正常运行，运行<code>pnpm approve-builds -a</code>放行即可。</p></blockquote><h2 id="运行"><a href="#运行" class="headerlink" title="运行"></a>运行</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">hexo clean <span class="hljs-comment">#= hexo c # 清除本地缓存，也就是清除public/文件夹和db.json文件。</span><br>hexo generate <span class="hljs-comment">#= hexo g # 将souce文件夹下的Markdown和HTML文件解析到了public文件夹下，并生成了db.json文件</span><br>hexo server <span class="hljs-comment">#= hexo s # 开启本地调试模式</span><br>hexo deploy <span class="hljs-comment">#= hexo d # 将本地资源部署到Github Pages</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
